⫻display/header:
  Subject: Live SpaceXAI Invoke (KickGuard consent)

⫻display/content:
Click CONSENT & INVOKE in the QML6 bar. KickGuard will not call api.x.ai until that click.
Requires XAI_API_KEY (scripts/run.sh writes a runtime key file; the C++ host reads the env var).
